      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present our experience of a unique opportunity to survey coronary artery bypass graft (CABG) patency following the administration of recombinant factor VIIa in the early postoperative period. A review of the published literature on use of this medication in cardiothoracic surgery, specifically CABG, is included."},
